---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Arrow from "../../components/Arrow.astro";
---

<BaseLayout metaTitle="山野场景来源与致谢" metaDescription="小麦在野首页三维山谷使用的航拍影像、地形数据与岩壁素材来源。">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container credits-page">
      <header class="page-heading">
        <a class="back-link" href="/"><Arrow direction="left" /> 回到山野</a>
        <h1 class="page-title">山野的来处</h1>
        <p class="page-desc">首页的三维山谷以瑞士劳特布龙嫩及周边山地为基础。感谢以下开放数据与素材，让这段漫游成为可能。</p>
      </header>
      <div class="personal-prose">
        <section aria-labelledby="imagery-title">
          <h2 id="imagery-title">航拍影像</h2>
          <p>© swisstopo · 瑞士联邦地形局</p>
          <p>SWISSIMAGE 彩色正射影像呈现了山林、草地与岩壁的真实色彩，并用作场景的地表纹理。</p>
          <p class="source-links"><a href="https://www.swisstopo.admin.ch/en/orthoimage-swissimage-10" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">了解 SWISSIMAGE</a><a href="https://www.swisstopo.admin.ch/en/faq-free-geodata" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">使用条款</a></p>
        </section>
        <section aria-labelledby="terrain-title">
          <h2 id="terrain-title">山谷地形</h2>
          <p>Mapzen Terrain Tiles / Tilezen Joerd</p>
          <p>高程数据构建了山脊与谷地的起伏，让镜头能够在山野中连续穿行。</p>
          <p class="source-note" lang="en">Produced using Copernicus data and information funded by the European Union — EU-DEM layers. Includes USGS SRTM and GMTED elevation data where applicable.</p>
          <p class="source-links"><a href="https://registry.opendata.aws/terrain-tiles/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">了解地形数据</a><a href="https://github.com/tilezen/joerd/blob/master/docs/attribution.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">来源与授权</a></p>
        </section>
        <section aria-labelledby="rock-title">
          <h2 id="rock-title">岩壁细节</h2>
          <p>Rock Face 03 · Poly Haven</p>
          <p>Dario Barresi 与 Rico Cilliers 创作的岩石纹理，为陡坡补充了表面细节。素材以 CC0 许可提供。</p>
          <p class="source-links"><a href="https://polyhaven.com/a/rock_face_03" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">查看原始素材</a><a href="https://polyhaven.com/license" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">许可说明</a></p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .credits-page { max-width: 820px; }
  .back-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .page-heading { margin-bottom: 44px; }
  .page-desc { max-width: 640px; }
  .source-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 28px; }
  .personal-prose .source-note { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--color-muted); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .page-title { font-size: 30px; }
    .page-heading { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  }
</style>
